   "notes": [
    "<p>stakeholders in the strategic planning process as well as the components of a strategic plan including the vision, mission, values, goals, priorities and initiatives.</p>",
    "<p>Review of Public Consultation Sessions, Review of Public Survey Results and Review of Draft SWOT (Strengths, Weaknesses, Opportunities, Threats) Analysis</p>",
    "<p>As part of the building of the strategic plan process, Dave Augustyn outlined the consultation process; the input from senior staff, document review, environmental scan, SWOT (Strengths, Weaknesses, Opportunities, Threats) analysis and public involvement (two open houses, public survey and feedback from high school students).</p>"
